@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
scale max 1600 width

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam ArrowThickness 3
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 120
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  BorderThickness 2
  RoundCorner 24
}
title <size:34><b>State-Driven AutoResearch Loop</b></size>\n<size:20>Every Execution writes the State that launches the next one.</size>

rectangle "<size:24><b>Durable Research State S(n)</b></size>\n\n<size:18><b>Machine state</b>  ·  <b>Semantic state</b></size>\n<size:17>state.json  ·  handoff.md</size>\n<size:17>evidence  ·  durable artifacts</size>" as State #DBEAFE

rectangle "<size:24><b>Fresh Claude Code Execution E(n)</b></size>\n\n<size:18>Tools  ·  Native Tasks</size>\n<size:18>Related experiments</size>\n<size:17>Semantically coherent; bounded by hard limits</size>" as Execution #FFEDD5

rectangle "<size:23><b>Commit State S(n+1)</b></size>\n\n<size:17>Model updates handoff.md</size>\n<size:17>Runtime merges structured output</size>" as Commit #EDE9FE

rectangle "Evidence-gated\ncomplete?" as Gate #DCFCE7

rectangle "<size:23><b>result.json</b></size>\n<size:17>Verified completion</size>" as Result #BBF7D0

rectangle "<size:21><b>Execution disappears</b></size>\n<size:17>crash  ·  timeout  ·  context loss</size>\n<size:17>Restart from the last durable State</size>" as Interrupted #FEE2E2

State -right-> Execution : instantiate
Execution -right-> Commit : checkpoint
Commit -down-> Gate
Gate -right-> Result : yes
Gate -left-> State : no — continue

Execution -down-> Interrupted
Interrupted -left-> State : recover

caption <size:20><b>The process may stop. The research loop continues from durable State.</b></size>\n<size:16>Continues until evidence-gated completion or a configured hard limit.</size>

@enduml
